    "recap": "In Day 4 (Complex Financial Instruments, ASC 326 CECL Credit Losses & Hedge Accounting), you mastered foundational workflows and verified deterministic execution outputs. Today in Day 5 (Milestone 1 Capstone: Global Financial Controller War Room & SEC Form 10-K Consolidation), we build directly on that foundation by mastering Multi-Entity Enterprise Consolidation & Intercompany Elimination (ASC 810 / IFRS 10) and ASC 230 Statement of Cash Flows Reconstruction (Operating Indirect Method)."
