          "answerIndex": 3,
          "explanation": "Cryptographic hash chaining creates a tamper-evident audit trail where any unauthorized modification or deletion of a past voucher invalidates the hash of all subsequent entries, supporting the audit-trail (edit log) requirement of Rule 3(1) of the Companies (Accounts) Rules, 2014."
