          "explanation": "Module 2 confirms Capitalized Development = $24,000,000.00, Year 1 Amortization (6 months) = $1,500,000.00, Patent Carrying = $22,500,000.00, plus Brand ($8.0M) = $30,500,000.00 Total Intangibles."
